        "model": "ChatGPT Codex"
      },
      "text": "You have two free days on Barú. With no excursions scheduled, you can unwind by the Caribbean Sea. We’ve left this part of the itinerary open after the busy programme in Bogotá, Medellín and Cartagena. Spend the day on the beach, walk along the shore or enjoy the hotel facilities at your own pace.\n\nBreakfast, lunch and dinner are included on both days."
